@startuml context
' Context diagram: libra, its users and the external systems.
' Render: paste into https://www.plantuml.com/plantuml or use the
' PlantUML extension in VS Code, then save as context.png here.
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

actor "Reader" as reader
actor "Household\nadministrator" as admin
actor "Researcher" as researcher

rectangle "libra\n(self-hosted web system:\nFastAPI + SQLite + React client)" as libra

cloud "DeepSeek API\n(descriptors)" as deepseek
node "SMTP mail server" as smtp
cloud "Amazon\nSend to Kindle" as amazon
database "Standard Ebooks\n(test books, CC0)" as se

reader --> libra : questions, reading,\nnotes, Send to Kindle
admin --> libra : accounts, books,\nsettings
researcher --> libra : rag commands\n(index, evaluate, report)
libra --> deepseek : chunk text / question
deepseek --> libra : descriptors (JSON)
libra --> smtp : EPUB as e-mail attachment
smtp --> amazon : e-mail to @kindle.com
se ..> libra : 40 EPUB files\n(loaded once)
@enduml
